WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.291
-It's been decades since the Land of Wolves had a top hero...

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:06.041
but there was one hope.

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:08.583
-Ha ha! Gotcha, Sensei Garnett!

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:11.666
-Get outta here with that mess, lil [beep].

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.791
You ain't no wolf, you barely a dog.

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:17.000
-Shifty!

00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:20.166
Run away to Bean Town again, oldhead.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.208
-That ain't trash talk. This is TRASH TALK. 

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:26.416
You [beep beep beep] little [beep] [beep].

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:31.666
-Man, you not even supposed to say stuff like that anymore. 

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:35.166
-If you not ready to hear that s**t, then you ain't ready for your test. 

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:37.291
-YOU AIN'T READY!!!!

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:39.333
-But young Ant would not be deterred...

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.416
-Man, I'll show him not ready...

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.833
-Superstar. Superstar. Superstar.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:48.041
-You see once a year, all the top heroes put aside their

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.291
differences for a sacred ritual.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.416
-Bring forth the candidate.

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:56.791
-A ritual to see who is worthy to make the leap.

00:00:56.791 --> 00:00:58.041
-If you make the leap, 

00:00:58.041 --> 00:00:59.541
you will get untold riches,

00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:03.208
adoring fans, and various vanity projects, such as  

00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:04.916
a mini golf game show. 

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:08.750
-After I made MY leap, people learned how to pronounce my name!

00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:13.083
-Mikal, in your last village, you were the third option at best...

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:16.916
but now, Brooklyn thinks they may finally have a hero.

00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:19.791
Are you ready...TO TAKE THE LEAP?!

00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.458
-LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP. LEAP.

00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:28.958
♪♪♪ THEME SONG ♪♪♪

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.291
-MIKAL'S... BRIDGES!

00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:54.291
woah!

00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:58.791
-Minnesota has suffered too long without a star...

00:01:58.791 --> 00:01:59.708
