00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:12.041
-Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap!

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:14.500
-Now or never!
- Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap!

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.458
